      "message_parsed": "Доброго времени суток! Если создавать название форума через админку с апострофом (для тех кто не знает как он выглядит -&gt; <b>&#039; </b>)<br />\n<a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/4678/\"><img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/data/attachments/4/4682-391304703ea61f57a272f3d4cb6de012.jpg?hash=B-mlA0gS2N\" alt=\"scr1.webp\" /></a><br />\n<br />\n, то появляется сообщение об ошибке:<br />\n<img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/4681/\" alt=\"scr2.webp\" /> <br />\nСсылается на эту строчку:<br />\n<img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/4680/\" alt=\"scr3.webp\" /><br />\n<br />\nВ логах MySQL следующее:<br />\n<code style=\"font-family: Monaco, 'Andale Mono', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\nfont-size: 0.9em;\nfont-style: normal;\nline-height: 1.3em;\nbackground: #BFE6FF;\nborder: 1px solid #C6C6EA;\nborder-radius: 3.5px;\npadding: 1px 3px;\ncolor: #0F4D79;\ndisplay: inline-block;\nmargin-bottom: 2px;\"><br />\n#001064 You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near &#039;n&#039;Roll&#039;, 4, &#039;&#039;, 15, 0, 0, 152, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 3, 3, 1, 1, 1, 1)&#039; at line 1<br />\n<br />\nINSERT INTO bb_forums ( forum_name, cat_id, forum_desc, forum_order, forum_status, prune_days, forum_parent, show_on_index, forum_display_sort, forum_display_order, tt_view, auth_view, auth_read, auth_post, auth_reply, auth_edit, auth_delete, auth_sticky, auth_announce, auth_vote, auth_pollcreate, auth_attachments, auth_download) VALUES (&#039;Rock&#039;n&#039;Roll&#039;, 4, &#039;&#039;, 15, 0, 0, 152, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 3, 3, 1, 1, 1, 1)<br />\n<br />\nSource  : admin/admin_forums.php(244) :: db1.freetor<br />\nIP      : XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX<br />\nDate    : 2017-02-20 12:42:28<br />\nAgent   : Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.1; WOW64; rv:51.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/51.0<br />\nReq_URI : /admin/admin_forums.php<br />\nReferer : <a href=\"http://syte.ru/admin/admin_forums.php?mode=addforum&amp;forum_parent=152\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">http://syte.ru/admin/admin_forums.php?mode=addforum&amp;forum_parent=152</a><br />\nMethod  : POST<br />\nPID     : 27689<br />\nRequest : Array<br />\n(<br />\n    [mode] =&gt; createforum<br />\n    [f] =&gt;<br />\n    [forumname] =&gt; Rock&#039;n&#039;Roll<br />\n    [forumdesc] =&gt;<br />\n    [forum_parent] =&gt; 152<br />\n    [c] =&gt; 4<br />\n    [show_on_index] =&gt; 1<br />\n    [forumstatus] =&gt; 0<br />\n    [allow_reg_tracker] =&gt; 1<br />\n    [self_moderated] =&gt; 0<br />\n    [allow_porno_topic] =&gt; 0<br />\n    [forum_tpl_select] =&gt; 0<br />\n    [prune_days] =&gt; 0<br />\n    [forum_display_sort] =&gt; 0<br />\n    [forum_display_order] =&gt; 0<br />\n    [tt_view] =&gt; 0<br />\n    [submit] =&gt; Создать новый форум<br />\n)______________________________________________________________________________<br />\n</code><br />\n<br />\n<b>Версия движка 2.1.4 (возможно, что в новой версии этой ошибки уже нет).</b>",
